  },
  {
   "k": "26d629b506",
   "src": "Articles, news and press releases on running marketplaces for premium brands, written by the people doing the work and dated so you know they are current.",
   "t": "这里汇集关于为高端品牌运营电商平台业务的文章、新闻和新闻稿。所有内容均由实际从事这项工作的人撰写，并注明发布日期，便于您判断信息是否仍然适用。"
  },
  {
   "k": "d25a98fffa",
   "src": "Four kraft parcels on a stone ledge against a sunlit navy wall, rising in height like a bar chart, with the Kwontified logo",
   "t": "阳光照射的海军蓝墙前，石台上四个牛皮纸包裹像柱状图一样由低到高排列，旁边是 Kwontified 标志"
  },
