  {
   "k": "691b4f3649",
   "src": "What we learn running marketplaces for premium brands, written by the people doing the work and dated so you know it is current.",
   "t": "我们在为高端品牌运营电商平台业务的过程中积累的经验，由实际从事这项工作的人撰写，并注明日期，便于您判断内容的时效。"
  },
  {
   "k": "d8e3f33c2a",
   "src": "Here you will find articles on how we run marketplaces, news on platform changes and what they mean for brands, and press releases. Our monthly newsletter, the Kwontified Briefing, goes out by email. Search below, or filter by type, topic, channel, author or month.",
   "t": "在这里，您可以读到讲述我们如何运营电商平台业务的文章、关于平台变化及其对品牌影响的新闻，以及新闻稿。我们的月度简报 Kwontified Briefing 通过电子邮件发送。您可以在下方搜索，或按类型、主题、渠道、作者或月份筛选。"
  },
