  {
   "k": "dfe890b074",
   "src": "Holiday 2026: the season now starts in October",
   "t": "2026年假日季：如今从10月开始"
  },
  {
   "k": "83600bc62b",
   "src": "The 2026 holiday season now runs from early October to late December. What the forecasts show, how the season stretched, and how to plan each of its phases.",
   "t": "2026年假日季如今从10月初延续到12月底。预测数据显示了什么，假日季是如何拉长的，以及如何规划其中的每个阶段。"
  },
  {
